# Base44 Boundary Rules

Base44 is only the Admin GUI and control plane.

Base44 may build:
- dashboard
- scanner results table
- trade approval queue
- risk settings forms
- strategy settings forms
- Greeks settings forms
- Fibonacci settings forms
- logs
- model performance page
- backend proxy functions

Base44 must not build:
- IBKR/TWS direct connection
- live broker execution
- Python scanner
- ML training
- market data ingestion daemon
- long-running trading loop
- broker credential storage

Base44 functions may only proxy requests to the external Python FastAPI backend.

Every Base44 action must call the backend.
The backend is final authority.
